gU9(){return"How to add a second account (Multi-account)?"},
gU8(){return"Answer: Go to Profile -> 'Switch account'. On the start screen, click 'Log in with password' and enter the data for the second profile. Both accounts will be saved, and you can switch between them in one click!"},
gacs(){return"How to delete a saved account?"},
gacr(){return"Answer: On the account selection screen, simply swipe the unnecessary profile left or press and hold it (long press) and select 'Delete'."},
gacq(){return"Are teacher reviews really anonymous?"},
gacp(){return"Answer: Yes, absolutely. The application does not show your name to other users. However, for using profanity or direct insults, the administration may apply sanctions and transfer the data to the university."},
gacu(){return"How to view a student's study history?"},
gact(){return"Answer: Find the student in search or in the friends list, swipe left to right on their card, and click on the appearing profile icon (magnifying glass with a person)."},
